<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},<div><br></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">You recently requested
some information on the Biology &amp; society graduate program at ASU. Please review this&nbsp;<span style="color:blue"><a href="https://sols.asu.edu/graduate-studies/degrees/bio-and-society">useful website</a></span>;
it will provide you with an overview of the program along with detailed
information about how to apply.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">To apply for the fall
2017 semester, we must receive your application between&nbsp;<b>October 1 and
December 15</b>. Our priority deadline for the fall semester is&nbsp;<b>December
1</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">If you need further
information or have any questions, please let me know.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><b><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: 'Kunstler Script';">Wendi Simonson</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#990000">Arizona State
